# A directory with a qmldir is a MODULE, and a module resolves only the types it
# lists -- the "any .qml file beside me is a type" rule stops applying the moment
# this file exists. So the singletons here force everything else to be listed
# too; see shell/qmldir, which says the same thing about the directory above.
singleton Settings 1.0 Settings.qml
singleton Schema 1.0 Schema.qml
singleton Rules 1.0 Rules.qml
singleton Matugen 1.0 Matugen.qml
SettingsWindow 1.0 SettingsWindow.qml
OptionRow 1.0 OptionRow.qml
Slider 1.0 Slider.qml
ColorField 1.0 ColorField.qml
SmallButton 1.0 SmallButton.qml
